Z||000000||Seanh||03-20-2001||10:04 PM||||I just got my engine together and noticed I didnt put the dipstick back in. I already forgot how it goes in there. Can some one tell me, or better yet scan something that shows me? Where does it bolt to? I am think the screw that holds the coolant crossover pipe to the front of the engine, but Im not sure? Thanks||||reg||1
